'''Nono''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] increases her movement speed, decreases backswing and cost, and gains a 50% chance to [[Survive|survive]] a lethal strike as well as [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]].

